  - text: Rika?
    displayText: Rika?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $.$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fe9e64057009084a9c5653faca90639, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 000000000100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yes.
    displayText: Yes.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It is$.$.$. $$beautiful$.$.$.
    displayText: It is... beautiful...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000006000000070000000900000009000000120000001300000014000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $.$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 000000000100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Haha$.$.$.
    displayText: Haha...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 040000000500000006000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika?
    displayText: Rika?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru$.$.$.$$ How can I forget you?$$$ My first real friend$.$.$.
    displayText: Mahiru... How can I forget you? My first real friend...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000070000000800000009000000090000001f0000001f0000001f000000340000003500000036000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $.$.$.$Rika, $$you remember her now?
    displayText: ...Rika, you remember her now?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 000000000100000002000000030000000900000009000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yeah$.$.$. $$I met her first when I entered high school.
    displayText: Yeah... I met her first when I entered high school.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000060000000800000008000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She was always wearing a plum blossom with her$$$ and always acted very
      stupidly and cute.
    displayText: She was always wearing a plum blossom with her and always acted
      very stupidly and cute.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2e0000002e0000002e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: In the middle of an environment where everyone tries to manipulate others
      for their own needs,$$$$ she is just there, $$enjoying life with me.
    displayText: In the middle of an environment where everyone tries to manipulate
      others for their own needs, she is just there, enjoying life with me.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 5e0000005e0000005e0000005e0000007200000072000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You seem very fond of her$.$.$. $$How is she different from others?
    displayText: You seem very fond of her... How is she different from others?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 190000001a0000001b0000001d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Well, $$firstly, $$she\u2019s not special at all. $$$No talent. $$$Not
      popular. $$$Nothing notable except her extreme naivety. "
    displayText: "Well, firstly, she\u2019s not special at all. No talent. Not popular.
      Nothing notable except her extreme naivety. "
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000000f0000000f000000290000002900000029000000340000003400000034000000410000004100000041000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She never wanted to learn art from me.$$$$ She never wanted to talk to
      me.$$$$ She just sits beside me all the time, $$$at every chance possible.
    displayText: She never wanted to learn art from me. She never wanted to talk
      to me. She just sits beside me all the time, at every chance possible.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 26000000260000002600000026000000460000004600000046000000460000006d0000006d0000006d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Isn\u2019t that$.$.$. $$weird$.$.$.$?"
    displayText: "Isn\u2019t that... weird...?"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000b0000000c0000000e0000000e00000013000000140000001500000016000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It is.
    displayText: It is.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "It\u2019s super weird having someone following me like that and not even
      trying to speak to me."
    displayText: "It\u2019s super weird having someone following me like that and
      not even trying to speak to me."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But it somehow felt comfortable.
    displayText: But it somehow felt comfortable.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "It\u2019s like$.$.$. $$$$that\u2019s the thing I\u2019d been wanting all
      along. $$$$Just someone, $$being with me, $$being happy$.$.$."
    displayText: "It\u2019s like... that\u2019s the thing I\u2019d been wanting all
      along. Just someone, being with me, being happy..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 090000000a0000000b0000000d0000000d0000000d0000000d0000003a0000003a0000003a0000003a00000048000000480000005700000057000000620000006300000064000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Then, $$as if that happiness can be transmitted through air, $$the scent
      of the plum blossom enters my nose and I feel like I\u2019m allowed to be happy
      too$.$.$."
    displayText: "Then, as if that happiness can be transmitted through air, the
      scent of the plum blossom enters my nose and I feel like I\u2019m allowed to
      be happy too..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000003b0000003b000000930000009400000095000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "And that\u2019s why you consider her your first actual friend$.$.$."
    displayText: "And that\u2019s why you consider her your first actual friend..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 38000000390000003a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Are you jealous? $$$I can\u2019t pinpoint the exact date, $$but I have
      a strong feeling that you met me after Mahiru though."
    displayText: "Are you jealous? I can\u2019t pinpoint the exact date, but I have
      a strong feeling that you met me after Mahiru though."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1100000011000000110000003200000032000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Haha$.$.$.$$ I think I am$.$.$.
    displayText: Haha... I think I am...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000060000000700000007000000140000001500000016000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'One day, $$I thought it was the time to speak up, $$and I introduced myself
      to Mahiru. '
    displayText: 'One day, I thought it was the time to speak up, and I introduced
      myself to Mahiru. '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 09000000090000003000000030000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "She instantly accepts me as a friend. $$$$But I guess I\u2019m quite weak
      for this type of person. "
    displayText: "She instantly accepts me as a friend. But I guess I\u2019m quite
      weak for this type of person. "
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 26000000260000002600000026000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "She\u2019s so naive that I can\u2019t leave her alone, $$$so I practically
      became an inseparable part of her life from then on\u2026"
    displayText: "She\u2019s so naive that I can\u2019t leave her alone, so I practically
      became an inseparable part of her life from then on\u2026"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2d0000002d0000002d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```*Brrrrrrr-chk!*'
    displayText: '*Brrrrrrr-chk!*'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Oh\u2026$$$ We\u2019re still in this dimension,$$ huh? My priority should
      be escaping this room$.$.$."
    displayText: "Oh\u2026 We\u2019re still in this dimension, huh? My priority should
      be escaping this room..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0300000003000000030000002200000022000000500000005100000052000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yeah$.$.$.$$ I think so$.$.$.
    displayText: Yeah... I think so...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1899c048cbc3cbf46ad8477960b7a91e, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000060000000700000007000000120000001300000014000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Let\u2019s go, $$Maya. $$$$And sorry if telling stories about Mahiru makes
      you uncomfortable\u2026"
    displayText: "Let\u2019s go, Maya. And sorry if telling stories about Mahiru
      makes you uncomfortable\u2026"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a00000010000000100000001000000010000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Au$.$.$.
    displayText: Au...
    color: 0
